WEBVTT

00:09:29.690 --> 00:09:31.483
We can value it in dollars and cents.

00:09:31.483 --> 00:09:33.736
Question is, what are you
going to do with it?

00:09:33.736 --> 00:09:35.988
Well, guess what?
We can build a whole economy

00:09:35.988 --> 00:09:38.574
around a living and thriving nature,

00:09:38.574 --> 00:09:40.784
not an extractive view of nature,

00:09:40.784 --> 00:09:43.078
but a regenerative view of nature.

00:09:44.079 --> 00:09:45.414
And that economy --

00:09:45.456 --> 00:09:46.624
(Applause)

00:09:46.665 --> 00:09:47.916
Thank you.

00:09:47.958 --> 00:09:54.715
That economy is going to deliver for us
sustainable and shared prosperity

00:09:54.757 --> 00:10:00.179
for all, big and small,
all creatures on this planet.